==English==

===Adjective===
'''charitable'''
# pertaining to [[charity]]
# kind, generous
# having a purpose or character of a charity
'''charitable purpose''' is defined in the law as being one that is for the support or benefit of; 
# the advancement of learning and [[education]], 
# [[religion]], 
# relief of [[poverty]] or 
# other objects beneficial to the advancement of [[society]].
